Package: libpoppler-glib8
Version: @DEB_POPPLER_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: Libraries
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://poppler.freedesktop.org/
Depends: libpoppler140 (= @DEB_POPPLER_V@), libglib2.0-0, libcairo2, libfreetype6, libintl8
Description: PDF rendering library - GLib interface
 Poppler is a PDF rendering library based on the xpdf-3.0 code base. This package
 contains the shared library for the GLib-based interface (libpoppler-glib), used
 by GTK document viewers such as Papers/Evince.
